{
  "title": "Hearty Homemade Venezuelan Sauerkraut Empanadas",
  "description": "A sweet and juicy Venezuelan dish featuring sauerkraut, shaped like nigiri and cooked in a terracotta dish, perfect for a quick fix, diabetic-friendly meal.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
  "diet": [
    "diabetic-friendly",
